Let me tell you this;
You can grow your account without the help of anyone. Just create a mutual connection with your followers, engage their posts, and also try as much as possible to get more followers everyday. 
Stop worrying that "big accounts" are not helping you. Help yourself first.

@sarkinnomaa Perfect! Am agree with you!
